328e5a": "岸边|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "901742ff": "小岛|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ff34b6ca": "沿着|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2fb5b4a8": "一座|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9cc08599": "大桥|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1ff7a864": "柱子|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2fbe2333": "狮子|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e2924efe": "十分|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "be72cbc6": "好啊|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e7cb52e4": "今天天气真好，湖边的风景好看极了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4f8a823f": "湖水的颜色很蓝，像一块大玻璃。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fa9f7d7b": "我们划着小船，到了湖的对岸。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d284ee41": "沿着湖边走了一会儿，我们看见了宝岛。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c43a91fb": "小岛上有很多高高的树。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dc471f34": "要去那儿，先要走过一座石桥。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7440004c": "这座大桥又长又宽，走起来很稳。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9dbb9a6d": "桥边立着一根一根的柱子。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7f3277e0": "每根柱子上都有一只小石狮子。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "14ff09d9": "这些小狮子十分可爱，我一直看。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1e4a1e37": "我们一口气登上了岛上的小山。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "02cc575f": "好高啊！山下的人都变小了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0ef6bd01": "这是一个美丽的地方，我很喜欢这里。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f129de8b": "美好的一天过得真快。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eee3686b": "走完了回家的路，我又想再来一次了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c372e2ef": "爸爸，湖对岸那个小岛叫什么名字？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dde9b5fe": "它叫宝岛。我们沿着湖边走过去吧！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "afa79015": "看，前面有一座石桥！桥上的柱子真多。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "083d810e": "柱子上还站着小石狮子，有的张着嘴，有的闭着眼。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e3c4f82d": "这些小狮子可真好玩啊！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6c39138f": "看完小狮子，我们比一比，看谁先登上山顶！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e66d911b": "好高啊！这里的景色十分美丽。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b514f517": "对！我们买一张明信片，写给你的好朋友吧！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fa87a904": "美好|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7a905184": "美国|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4238eac6": "秀丽|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f8e64f95": "丽江|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "310b5c9a": "吃完|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7347c788": "写完|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "71592366": "登高|zh-CN-X